OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 8 MAY
OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GA specially curated sequence of
OL,6,     Gsome of Sir David Attenborough's
OL,7,     Gfavourite music tracks,
OL,8,     Gcelebrating his 100th birthday
OL,9,     Gtoday.
OL,10,G1930FFriday Night is Music Night
OL,11,     GThe BBC Concert Orchestra and the
OL,12,     GCentral Band of the Royal Air
OL,13,     GForce commemorate the 80th
OL,14,     Ganniversary of VE Day, in concert
OL,15,     Gat Alexandra Palace Theatre.
OL,16,G2145FThe Essay: The Insect Singers
OL,17,     GThe Insect Singers trill their
OL,18,     Glast sonorous Essay. 5. Good
OL,19,     GVibrations - Treehoppers. Through
OL,20,     Gthe discipline of biotremology,
OL,21,     GRex Cocroft reveals an
OL,22,     Gextraordinarily resonant world.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
