OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 8 MAY
OL,4,G2200FLate Junction
OL,5,     GOn Sir David Attenborough's 100th
OL,6,     Gbirthday, Verity Sharp presents a
OL,7,     Gcollaborative mixtape celebrating
OL,8,     Ginterspecies connection from
OL,9,     Gartist Rebecca Lennon and writer
OL,10,     GElla Finer.
OL,11,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,12,     GThe photographer, author, and
OL,13,     Gcurator of Moment's Notice gig
OL,14,     Gseries is in the mix.
OL,15,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,16,     GFrom the Schubertiade Hohenems
OL,17,     GFestival, violinist Renaud
OL,18,     GCapucon and pianist Guillaume
OL,19,     GBellom play sonatas by Schubert,
OL,20,     GBeethoven and Schumann. Jonathan
OL,21,     GSwain presents.
